[
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "中华人民共和国国家标准",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "技术制 图比黃 例",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Technical drawings Scales ",
        "text_level": 0,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "GB/T 14690—93 ",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "代替GB4457.2—84 ",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "本标准等效采用国际标准ISO5455—1979《技术制图—比例》。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1主题内容与适用范围",
        "text_level": 1,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "本标准规定了绘图比例及其标注方法。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "本标准适用于技术图样及有关技术文件。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2 引用标准",
        "text_level": 1,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "GB/T 13361 技术制图 通用术语",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "了术语",
        "text_level": 1,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.1比例 scale ",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "图中图形与其实物相应要素的线性尺寸之比。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.2 原值比例 full size ",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "比值为1的比例，即1：1。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.3放大比例 enlargement scale ",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "比值大于1的比例，如2：1等。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.4缩小比例 reduction scale",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "比值小于1的比例，如1：2等。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4 比例系列",
        "text_level": 1,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4.1需要按比例绘制图样时，应由表1规定的系列中选取适当的比例。",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "注： $n$ 为正整数。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "table",
        "img_path": "/home/crrc/PycharmProjects/FlaskOllama/data/parse_files_data/1960001028447428608/4a2f0672530896a6ac7c6d60ee568c3638cbcfa00d65deff01413160312cce53.jpg",
        "table_caption": [
            "表1"
        ],
        "table_footnote": [
            "1994-07-01实施 ",
            "1 "
        ],
        "table_body": "\n\n<html><body><table><tr><td>种 类</td><td>比 例</td></tr><tr><td>原值比例 1:1</td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>5:1</td><td>2:1</td></tr><tr><td>放大比例 5×10\":1</td><td>2×10:1 1×10\":1</td></tr><tr><td>1:2</td><td>1:5 1:10</td></tr><tr><td>缩小比例 1:2×10\" 1:5×10\"</td><td>1:1×10\"</td></tr></table></body></html>\n\n",
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4.2必要时，也允许选取表2中的比例。",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "国家技术监督局1993-11-09批准",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "table",
        "img_path": "/home/crrc/PycharmProjects/FlaskOllama/data/parse_files_data/1960001028447428608/e02844a2a7c26087ea1e684ba34e02c38ec3beb4c141d03473b13bb85e515978.jpg",
        "table_caption": [
            "表2"
        ],
        "table_footnote": [
            "2 "
        ],
        "table_body": "\n\n<html><body><table><tr><td>种类</td><td colspan=\"5\">比 例</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">放大比例</td><td>4:1</td><td colspan=\"2\">2.5:1</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>4×10\":1</td><td>2.5×10:1</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">缩小比例</td><td>1:1.5</td><td>1:2.5</td><td>1:3</td><td>1:4</td><td>1:6</td></tr><tr><td>1 :1.5×10\"</td><td>1:2.5×10m</td><td>1:3×10\"</td><td>1:4×10\"</td><td>1:6×10\"</td></tr></table></body></html>\n\n",
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "注： $n$ 为正整数。",
        "page_idx": 1,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5标注方法",
        "text_level": 1,
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5.1比例符号应以“：\"表示。比例的表示方法如 $1:1,1:500,20:1$ 等。",
        "page_idx": 1,
        "text_level": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5.2比例一般应标注在标题栏中的比例栏内。必要时，可在视图名称的下方或右侧标注比例,如：",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "table",
        "img_path": "/home/crrc/PycharmProjects/FlaskOllama/data/parse_files_data/1960001028447428608/a9e933a75657233e769a8ee7c42b3b0f8211d7eb8a73b272ce31486cce86611e.jpg",
        "table_caption": [],
        "table_footnote": [],
        "table_body": "\n\n<html><body><table><tr><td>I 2:1</td><td>A向 B—B 1:100 2.5: 1</td><td>墙板位置图 1:200</td><td>平面图1：100</td></tr></table></body></html>\n\n",
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5.3必要时，允许在同一视图中的铅垂和水平方向标注不同的比例（但两种比例的比值不应超过 5  \n倍),如： 4",
        "page_idx": 1,
        "text_level": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1OL 铅垂方向1：1000河流横剖面图水平方向1：2000",
        "page_idx": 1,
        "text_level": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5.4必要时，图样的比例可采用比例尺的形式。一般可在图样中的铅垂或水平方向加画比例尺。",
        "page_idx": 1,
        "text_level": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "附加说明：",
        "page_idx": 1,
        "text_level": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "本标准由全国技术制图标准化技术委员会提出。",
        "page_idx": 1,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "本标准由机械工业部机械标准化研究所、大连海运学院、东南大学、成都科技大学、武汉水利电力学院、中国建筑技术中心标准所等单位负责起草。",
        "page_idx": 1,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "本标准主要起草人何斯特、韦建华、杨东湃、唐人卫。",
        "page_idx": 1,
        "text_level": 0
    }
]